THE ARMS
--------
base        6c17d8c, unmodified
slotflag    per-slot live-flag bytes: publish and release become plain stores,
            the two locked RMWs (fetch_or / fetch_and) are gone
leaf        slotflag + `add`'s fast path made a frameless leaf (try_lock with a
            cold outlined contended path; overlap_panic takes 7 scalars instead
            of a 25-byte tuple).  0x80-byte frame + 3 stp/ldp pairs removed,
            143 -> 117 instructions
final       leaf + `mask == 0` instances skip the shift load, both block
            divisions and the multiplicative hash entirely
fold        REVERTED. final + the one-shard body duplicated so shard 0's
            address constant-folds
addnop      THROWAWAY `probe-addnop`: keeps the call, deletes the body
untracked   THROWAWAY `probe-untracked`: no tracker at all (the ceiling)


